:: escaped default
> line@0123456789abcdef0123 bind=(value:string=$value)
  Isolated opening \{
  Isolated closing \}
  Balanced \{name\}
  Opening \{ remains prose; closing \} remains prose; balanced \{name\} remains prose.
  Adjacent \{name\} and real {value} interpolation.
? choice@fedcba98765432100123 bind=(value:string=$value)
  Choice \{literal\} and real {value} interpolation.
  -> END
-> END
